id: explosive-wave
name: Explosive Wave
uaType: both
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score of 6+
tpCost: 10
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCostPerTier: 4
# "Make a Might Clash against all Characters within a Minor Sphere AoE (centered on you)" - who is inside asked
# (use-maneuver.mjs askHide, its burst); won, moved up to your Might away, as a Knockback moves them - its collision
# button with it (chat.mjs settleWave).
waves: true
sphereMagnitude: minor
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Might Clash against everyone within a Minor Sphere around you: won, they are moved up to your Might in Squares away -
  and a Grappler holding you lets go first.
text: >
  Explosive Wave: Using your energy, you forcefully push enemies away from you.
  –Ability Type: Technical/Magical
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score of 6+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –KP Cost: 4(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Instant
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Make a Might Clash against all Characters within a Minor Sphere AoE (centered on you). If you win, that
  Character is moved a number of Squares up to your Might in a straight line away from you.

  If you win the Might Clash for this effect against a Character who is in a Grapple with you as the Grappled and them
  as the Grappler, end that Grapple before applying the movement.
